*                     |     |     |    |    CURRENT OUTPUT
*                     |     |     |    |    |   V+
*                     |     |     |    |    |   |    V-
*                     |     |     |    |    |   |    |    BUFFER INPUT
*                     |     |     |    |    |   |    |    |    BUFFER OUTPUT
*                     |     |     |    |    |   |    |    |    |
.SUBCKT HALF13700    LIN   INP   INN  IAB  OUT VCC  VSS  BIN  BUF
QN1     IAB   VN2B   VSS   npnv     3
QN2     VN2B  VN2B   VSS   npnv     3
QN3     VN3C  IAB    VN2B  npnv     3
QN4     VP3B  INN    VN3C  npnv     3
QN5     VP6B  INP    VN3C  npnv     3
